msgid "Pirate"
msgstr "Pirate"

msgid "Pirate Marauders"
msgstr "Pirates maraudeurs"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Pirate Marauders are the lowest and most vile of pirates. They are extremely "
"aggressive and will attack most vessels unprovoked, despite flying ships "
"that would not be considered space-worthy in civilized areas. Even the "
"pirate clans have difficulty in dealing with them."
msgstr ""
"Les maraudeurs pirates sont les plus mauvais et les plus vils des pirates. "
"Ils sont extrêmement agressifs et attaquent la plupart des vaisseaux sans "
"être provoqués. Même les clans de pirates ont du mal à marchander avec eux."

msgid "Miner"
msgstr "Mineur"

msgid "Nasin"
msgstr "Nasin"

msgid "O'rez"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "House O'rez"
msgstr "Maison Za’lek"

msgid ""
"While still officially part of House Yetmer-O'rez, to all practical effects, "
"House O'rez is an independent minor house, engaged in a long war with House "
"Yetmer."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Galactic Space Pirates consists of independent pirate vessels not "
"affiliated with any particular clan. Due to their disorganized nature, they "
"tend to respect the clans they operate near."
msgstr ""
"Les pirates galactiques sont des vaisseaux pirates indépendants et sans "
"affiliations avec un clan quelconque. De par leur nature désorganisé, ils "
"ont tendance à respecter les clans dont ils sont proches."

msgid "Proteron"
msgstr "Protéron"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Sovereign Proteron Autarchy was an Imperial Great House that decided to "
"move and attack the Emperor himself. This caused the Incident and left the "
"universe irreversibly ravaged."
msgstr ""
"La Maison Perdue De Protéron était une importante maison impérial qui a "
"décidé de bouger et d'attaquer l'Empereur lui même. C'est ce qui a causé "
"l'Incident et laissé l'univers irrémédiablement ravagé."

msgid "Raven Pirate Clan"
msgstr "Le Clan Pirate Des Corbeaux"

msgid ""
"The Raven Pirate Clan is a band of pirates that lead over the widespread "
"Qorel sector between the Empire and Dvaered systems."
msgstr ""
"Le Clan Pirate des Corbeaux est une bande de pirates qui se domine le "
"secteur de Qorel entre les systèmes de l'Empire et des Dvaered."

